1
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:08,131
(Leonard:)I can't decide whether I want Stan Lee
to autograph...

2
00:00:08,293 --> 00:00:11,173
(Leonard:)...my Journey Into Mystery 83,
first appearance of Thor...

3
00:00:11,338 --> 00:00:15,588
...or my Fantastic Four Number 5,
first appearance of Dr. Doom.

4
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:17,759
["FINAL JEOPARDY!" THEME
PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

5
00:00:25,227 --> 00:00:29,017
Alex, I'm gonna go with:
"What is you're a dumb-ass?"

6
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:32,903
[RASPBERRY
PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

7
00:00:35,195 --> 00:00:39,575
(Sheldon:)I've decided I'm going to have Mr. Lee
sign my copy of this month's Batman.

8
00:00:39,908 --> 00:00:42,828
(Howard:)That's crazy. Stan Lee
had nothing to do with Batman.

9
00:00:42,995 --> 00:00:45,375
(Sheldon:)Which is why no one else
will ask him to sign one.

10
00:00:45,539 --> 00:00:48,539
I'll be the possessor of a unique,
albeit confusing artifact...

11
00:00:48,709 --> 00:00:52,549
(Sheldon:)...which will set me apart from
the hoi polloi of comic-book fandom.

12
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:57,430
That's a great idea. I'm gonna get him
to sign a Batman as well.

13
00:00:59,386 --> 00:01:02,426
What is it about the word "unique"
you don't understand?

